cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fastcharge: Fast-Charging Protocol Evaluation and Multi-Objective Optimization on ISU-ILCC"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-30"
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "ilo"
    given-names: "love7"
    alias: "ilo-love7"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ilo-love7/battery-fastcharge-opt"
keywords:
  - lithium-ion battery
  - fast charging
  - charging protocol optimization
  - Bayesian optimization
  - lithium plating
  - PyBaMM
  - ISU-ILCC
abstract: >-
  Multi-objective Bayesian optimization of lithium-ion fast-charging protocols on the
  ISU-ILCC aging dataset (240 cells, 61 protocols). Charging time is modelled with a
  measured CC+CV law, life with a Gaussian-process surrogate validated leave-one-group-out,
  and lithium plating is enforced as a hard constraint via PyBaMM's plating overpotential.
